 grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }\n    .dialogue.second .bubble:after {\n      left: auto;\n      right: -6px;\n      bottom: 10px;\n      border-width: 4px 0 4px 6px;\n      border-color: transparent transparent transparent #777;\n    }\n    .red-note {\n      color: #8d2031;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 16px;\n      transform: rotate(3deg);\n      position: absolute;\n      z-index: 2;\n    }\n    .note-one { top: 155px; right: 67px; }\n    .note-two { top: 364px; right: 41px; font-size: 15px; }\n    .note-three { top: 585px; right: 77px; font-size: 15px; }\n    .footer {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 29px;\n      bottom: 18px;\n      color: #1b728d;\n      font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .page-no {\n      border: 2px solid #1b728d;\n      width: 23px;\n      height: 23px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      text-align: center;\n      line-height: 19px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .footer-line { width: 27px; border-top: 1px solid #236b80; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"topline\">\n      <span class=\"brand\">同步解析与测评</span>\n      <span class=\"subject\">数学　五年级　下册</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <h1>3. 分数加减混合运算</h1>\n    <h2>第 1 课时　分数加减混合运算</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"explore\">探究 <span class=\"exchange\">交流</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"columns\">\n      <section class=\"left\">\n        <p class=\"intro\">小华收集整理的全国同学在母亲节送给妈妈<br>的礼物情况如下表。</p>\n\n        <table>\n          <tr>\n            <th>礼物类型</th>\n            <th>贺卡</th>\n            <th>鲜花</th>\n            <th>自己画的画</th>\n            <th>其他</th>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>占全班<br>人数的<br>几分之几</td>\n            <td>$\\frac{1}{4}$</td>\n            <td>$\\frac{3}{20}$</td>\n            <td>$\\frac{3}{10}$</td>\n            <td></td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n\n        <div class=\"problem\">1. 送贺卡和送鲜花的同学比送自己画的画<br>　的同学多占全班人数的几分之几？</div>\n        <div class=\"method\">方法一：</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$ \\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{3}{10} $</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$ =\\boxed{\\frac{5}{20}}+\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{3}{10} $ <span class=\"note\">→通分</span></div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$ =\\boxed{\\frac{8}{20}}-\\frac{3}{10} $</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$ =\\boxed{\\frac{8}{20}}-\\boxed{\\frac{6}{20}} $ <span class=\"note\">→再次通分</span></div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$ =\\frac{2}{20} $</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$ =\\frac{1}{10} $</div>\n\n        <div class=\"method\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">方法二：</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$ \\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{3}{10} $</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$ =\\boxed{\\frac{5}{20}}+\\frac{3}{20}-\\boxed{\\frac{6}{20}} $ <span class=\"note\">→一次通分</span></div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$ =\\frac{2}{20} $</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$ =\\frac{1}{10} $</div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"right\">\n        <div class=\"speech-row\">\n          <div class=\"figure\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">[图]</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bubble\">这两种方法有什么<br>相同点和不同点？</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"problem\">2. 送其他礼物的同学占全班人数的几分<br>　之几？</div>\n        <div class=\"method\">方法一：</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$1-\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{3}{10}$</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$=1-\\frac{5}{20}-\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{6}{20}$</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$=\\frac{20}{20}-\\frac{5}{20}-\\frac{3}{20}-\\frac{6}{20}$</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$=\\frac{6}{20}$</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$=\\frac{3}{10}$</div>\n\n        <div class=\"method\" style=\"margin-top:7px;\">方法二：</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$1-\\left(\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{3}{20}+\\frac{3}{10}\\right)$</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$=1-\\left(\\frac{5}{20}+\\frac{3}{20}+\\frac{6}{20}\\right)$</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$=1-\\frac{14}{20}$</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$=\\frac{6}{20}$</div>\n        <div class=\"calc\">$=\\frac{3}{10}$</div>\n\n        <section class=\"section-three\">\n          <div class=\"problem\">3. 通过前面的计算,你能说一说分数加减混<br>　合运算的运算顺序吗？</div>\n\n          <div class=\"dialogue\">\n            <div class=\"icon\">[图]</div>\n            <div class=\"bubble\">分数加减混合运算的运算<br>顺序和整数加减混合运算<br>的运算顺序相同。</div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"dialogue second\">\n            <div class=\"bubble\">没有括号的，按照从左<br>往右的顺序计算。有括<br>号的，要先算括号里面的。</div>\n            <div class=\"icon\">[图]</div>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"red-note note-one\">[illegible]<br>统一问题</div>\n    <div class=\"red-note note-two\">[illegible]</div>\n    <div class=\"red-note note-three\">[illegible]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <span>※</span><span class=\"page-no\">70</span><span class=\"footer-line\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
